a short distance away, providing direct connections to Frankfurt city center and the main train station in about 20 minutes.  \nAdditionally, the nearby “Niddastraße” bus stop offers several local bus lines (e.g. 551, (hidden)-64, n96) for convenient travel within Bad Vilbel and to surrounding areas.\n\n### Good to know ###\n- Occupancy: ideal for 1–2 people; 3rd person via sofa bed possible\n- All-inclusive rent applies to 1 person; +100 EUR per month for each additional person\n- Minimum stay: 6 months\n- No additional costs – utilities, heating, and Wi-Fi included\n\nThis stylish apartment is perfect for professionals, expats, or long-term stays – move in and feel at home immediately!","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"71.35"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":159000,"deposit":159000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1590